  "**The standard library** covers a lot: math, random numbers, dates, files, JSON, CSV, web requests (`urllib`), and more. Always check it first.\n\n**Third-party packages** are modules written by the community, shared on **PyPI** (the Python Package Index). You install them with **pip**, Python's package installer, in your computer's terminal:\n\n`pip install requests`\n\nUseful commands:\n\n- `pip install name` — install\n- `pip list` — see installed packages\n- `pip uninstall name` — remove\n- `pip install -r requirements.txt` — install everything a project needs\n\nProfessionals use a **virtual environment** (`python -m venv .venv`) so each project has its own packages.\n\n*The PyNest browser editor cannot run pip; it includes the full standard library.*",
  "**Standart kutubxona** koʻp narsani qamrab oladi: matematika, tasodifiy sonlar, sanalar, fayllar, JSON, CSV, veb-soʻrovlar (`urllib`) va boshqalar. Har doim avval unga qarang.\n\n**Tashqi paketlar** — hamjamiyat yozgan va **PyPI** (Python Package Index) da baham koʻrilgan modullar. Ularni kompyuteringiz terminalida Python paket oʻrnatuvchisi **pip** bilan oʻrnatasiz:\n\n`pip install requests`\n\nFoydali buyruqlar:\n\n- `pip install name` — oʻrnatish\n- `pip list` — oʻrnatilgan paketlarni koʻrish\n- `pip uninstall name` — olib tashlash\n- `pip install -r requirements.txt` — loyihaga kerakli hamma narsani oʻrnatish\n\nProfessionallar har bir loyiha oʻz paketlariga ega boʻlishi uchun **virtual muhitdan** (`python -m venv .venv`) foydalanadi.\n\n*PyNest brauzer muharriri pip ni ishga tushira olmaydi; unda toʻliq standart kutubxona bor.*",
